   725	  Synopsis    [Find the best matching of the cut.]
   726	
   727	  Description [The parameters: the node (pNode), the cut (pCut), the phase to be matched 
   728	  (fPhase), and the upper bound on the arrival times of the cut (fWorstLimit). This 
   729	  procedure goes through the matching supergates up to the phase assignment, and selects the
   730	  best supergate, which will be used to map the cut. As a result of calling this procedure
   731	  the matching information is written into pMatch.]
   732	               
